  factText: "Mycelium can replace plastics in packaging. For example, Ecovative\u2019s
    Mushroom\xAE Packaging grows fungus on waste fibers to form custom box shapes.
    The result is a foam-like material that cushions products yet fully composts
    back to earth, unlike Styrofoam."
